&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare RPC mention an interesting construct in the JS promises &lt;a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/rpc/#promise-pipelining"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.
They are using custom promise objects (that can be awaited) to batch (over the network) multiple RPC calls sequentially without awaiting the result of the first.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>